1
00:01:30,340 --> 00:01:33,578
=Against The Current=

2
00:01:33,579 --> 00:01:35,000
(Adapted from He Yanshan's novel,
Orchid Fragrance Fate)

3
00:01:35,180 --> 00:01:36,920
=Episode 13=
(This drama does not correspond)

4
00:01:36,930 --> 00:01:38,200
(to any real historical dynasty.)

5
00:01:38,210 --> 00:01:41,060
(The systems, culture, attire and other
dynastic elements have been adapted.)

6
00:01:41,070 --> 00:01:42,790
- Kick your shoes!
- Kick your shoes!

7
00:01:42,800 --> 00:01:45,250
- Drive out sickness and evil!
- Drive out sickness and evil!

8
00:01:45,350 --> 00:01:47,400
- Kick your shoes!
- Kick your shoes!

9
00:01:47,410 --> 00:01:49,750
- Drive out sickness and evil!
- Drive out sickness and evil!

10
00:01:49,760 --> 00:01:50,920
My turn!

11
00:01:54,260 --> 00:01:57,260
(Homemade Pickles)

12
00:02:06,056 --> 00:02:07,480
These are your reed down shoes?

13
00:02:08,120 --> 00:02:08,840
They look nice.

14
00:02:09,128 --> 00:02:10,408
Who made them for you?

15
00:02:11,030 --> 00:02:11,630
My mother.

16
00:02:15,840 --> 00:02:16,280
Here.

17
00:02:20,750 --> 00:02:23,310
♪Needles for sale♪

18
00:02:24,136 --> 00:02:24,730
What's this?

19
00:02:24,750 --> 00:02:27,800
♪Needles for sale♪

20
00:02:28,190 --> 00:02:31,590
♪Embroider flowers, stitch clouds,
make soles, sew shoes♪

21
00:02:32,030 --> 00:02:35,560
♪String peppers, stitch burlap sacks♪

22
00:02:35,720 --> 00:02:37,688
So these are the reed down shoes
you mentioned.

23
00:02:39,430 --> 00:02:41,030
Reed down isn't as warm as cotton,

24
00:02:42,000 --> 00:02:43,560
but for poor families,

25
00:02:43,570 --> 00:02:44,740
in the bitter cold of winter,

26
00:02:44,750 --> 00:02:46,550
having a pair
of reed down shoes like these

27
00:02:46,590 --> 00:02:47,520
is already a blessing.

28
00:02:47,730 --> 00:02:49,830
Poor families tend
to live in the south of the city,

29
00:02:49,840 --> 00:02:51,360
so that's where we should look.

30
00:02:52,120 --> 00:02:54,280
But how do you know those women

31
00:02:54,280 --> 00:02:56,360
would use padded coats
to make reed down shoes?

32
00:02:57,470 --> 00:02:58,840
Those women who used moldy cotton

33
00:02:58,840 --> 00:03:00,680
and reed fluff to make padded coats

34
00:03:01,080 --> 00:03:03,080
knew they were doing
something dishonest,

35
00:03:03,240 --> 00:03:04,470
yet they still did it.

36
00:03:04,800 --> 00:03:06,630
Either their families were poor,

37
00:03:06,960 --> 00:03:08,310
or they were greedy for profit.

38
00:03:08,840 --> 00:03:11,470
Most likely, it was both.

39
00:03:13,208 --> 00:03:14,248
Women like that

40
00:03:14,264 --> 00:03:16,290
are used to saving
and scraping wherever they can.

41
00:03:16,400 --> 00:03:18,000
They'd surely find a way

42
00:03:18,310 --> 00:03:20,590
to sneak out scraps of cloth and thread.

43
00:03:20,910 --> 00:03:22,590
They'd take whatever they could get.

44
00:03:23,280 --> 00:03:25,190
Scraps of cloth, reed down,

45
00:03:25,320 --> 00:03:26,470
and in the middle of winter,

46
00:03:26,870 --> 00:03:29,630
the most practical thing to make
would be reed down shoes.

47
00:03:31,280 --> 00:03:32,190
You're still young,

48
00:03:32,600 --> 00:03:34,190
yet you understand human nature well.

49
00:03:37,960 --> 00:03:39,910
Young Master,
have you ever heard this song?

50
00:03:41,400 --> 00:03:42,870
Snatch mud from a swallow's beak,

51
00:03:43,048 --> 00:03:44,560
shave iron from the tip of a needle,

52
00:03:45,710 --> 00:03:47,910
scrape gold from a Buddha's
face and search every inch.

53
00:03:48,120 --> 00:03:49,688
Find something where there's nothing,

54
00:03:50,430 --> 00:03:52,120
hunt for peas in a quail's crop,

55
00:03:52,280 --> 00:03:54,030
carve lean meat from a heron's leg,

56
00:03:54,360 --> 00:03:56,400
and extract oil from a mosquito's belly.

57
00:03:57,030 --> 00:03:58,520
What ruthless hands you have, sir.

58
00:04:02,000 --> 00:04:03,400
What a biting song.

59
00:04:07,128 --> 00:04:08,990
Young Master,
you've lived a life of privilege.

60
00:04:09,112 --> 00:04:11,352
You don't know that
for people at the bottom like us,

61
00:04:11,470 --> 00:04:12,960
sometimes just staying alive

62
00:04:13,430 --> 00:04:15,000
takes everything we have.

63
00:04:16,390 --> 00:04:17,800
If we want to rise above our station

64
00:04:17,800 --> 00:04:19,000
and live a little better,

65
00:04:19,600 --> 00:04:21,310
we may have to abandon our conscience

66
00:04:21,870 --> 00:04:23,000
and risk our lives.

67
00:04:25,016 --> 00:04:26,792
It's not that
I understand people so well.

68
00:04:27,310 --> 00:04:30,040
It's just like those reed down shoes.

69
00:04:30,376 --> 00:04:32,184
You've never seen them before,
Young Master,

70
00:04:32,600 --> 00:04:34,120
but we see them every day.

71
00:04:34,248 --> 00:04:35,896
There's nothing unusual about them.

72
00:04:45,976 --> 00:04:47,600
Though I'd never seen reed down shoes,

73
00:04:48,760 --> 00:04:50,160
I've also done everything I could

74
00:04:51,390 --> 00:04:52,600
just to survive.

75
00:04:56,680 --> 00:05:01,560
♪Rouge, hair ribbons,
combs and fine-toothed combs♪

76
00:05:02,040 --> 00:05:03,310
♪Come and buy♪

77
00:05:03,480 --> 00:05:04,750
♪Take some home♪

78
00:05:04,950 --> 00:05:07,510
♪Every household needs its daily wares♪

79
00:05:17,430 --> 00:05:18,390
Be careful.

80
00:05:32,160 --> 00:05:33,160
The peddler is back.

81
00:05:34,920 --> 00:05:35,870
Young Master is waiting.

82
00:05:35,870 --> 00:05:36,750
Hurry inside.

83
00:05:51,190 --> 00:05:52,160
These didn't sell.

84
00:06:12,040 --> 00:06:12,560
Hua,

85
00:06:13,070 --> 00:06:13,680
try some.

86
00:06:17,870 --> 00:06:18,630
It's so sweet.

87
00:06:43,560 --> 00:06:44,070
Young Master,

88
00:06:44,630 --> 00:06:45,390
we're back.

89
00:06:47,480 --> 00:06:48,040
No rush.

90
00:06:48,310 --> 00:06:48,984
Have some water.

91
00:06:49,016 --> 00:06:50,424
Sit down and tell me everything.

92
00:06:51,510 --> 00:06:51,950
Yes.

93
00:06:54,680 --> 00:06:55,630
While selling my wares,

94
00:06:55,640 --> 00:06:57,528
I struck up a conversation
with Fourth Lady Li,

95
00:06:57,530 --> 00:06:58,568
who makes reed down shoes.

96
00:06:58,600 --> 00:06:59,720
She told me that

97
00:06:59,730 --> 00:07:01,800
before the Chinese New Year,
she'd done some sewing

98
00:07:01,800 --> 00:07:02,968
for a family surnamed Luo.

99
00:07:03,800 --> 00:07:05,120
Following the lead she gave me,

100
00:07:05,240 --> 00:07:06,510
I found the Luo residence.

101
00:07:07,070 --> 00:07:09,070
Not only were their servants
strong and capable,

102
00:07:09,190 --> 00:07:10,290
but they also kept two dogs.

103
00:07:10,792 --> 00:07:11,600
Whenever I got close,

104
00:07:11,600 --> 00:07:12,630
the dogs barked fiercely.

105
00:07:12,790 --> 00:07:15,768
So I could only circle the outside
of the residence for most of the day

106
00:07:15,896 --> 00:07:17,928
until I knew
the surrounding terrain thoroughly.

107
00:07:20,536 --> 00:07:21,912
As you instructed, Young Master,

108
00:07:21,920 --> 00:07:23,750
I asked around
at the city's brokerage houses.

109
00:07:23,760 --> 00:07:26,070
I found that whenever
the Luo family hires mules and horses,

110
00:07:26,088 --> 00:07:27,752
they only hire the animals and carts.

111
00:07:27,760 --> 00:07:29,352
They always provide their own men.

112
00:07:30,430 --> 00:07:31,680
That's highly suspicious.

113
00:07:32,390 --> 00:07:34,750
Lu Dalang is almost certainly
hiding there.

114
00:07:35,384 --> 00:07:37,160
If you hadn't
been suspended, Young Master,

115
00:07:37,512 --> 00:07:39,310
we could bring in
some men from the army,

116
00:07:39,720 --> 00:07:41,560
block the roads
and surround the residence.

117
00:07:41,912 --> 00:07:44,712
They'd be trapped with nowhere to run,
and we'd be sure to catch them.

118
00:07:45,430 --> 00:07:45,750
But...

119
00:07:47,040 --> 00:07:49,720
But with so few of us now,

120
00:07:49,730 --> 00:07:52,480
I'm afraid that while we're still
dealing with the servants out front,

121
00:07:52,552 --> 00:07:55,032
Lu Dalang will have already
escaped through the back.

122
00:07:56,480 --> 00:07:57,920
Young Master has some friends

123
00:07:57,920 --> 00:07:59,270
in the Three Judicial Offices.

124
00:08:00,680 --> 00:08:03,390
Why don't we borrow some constables?

125
00:08:05,816 --> 00:08:07,310
For two or three thousand padded coats

126
00:08:07,320 --> 00:08:08,600
to be replaced with inferior ones

127
00:08:08,600 --> 00:08:10,350
and make their way
into the Shence Garrison,

128
00:08:10,360 --> 00:08:12,040
someone in
the government office must have

129
00:08:12,104 --> 00:08:13,890
been working
with Lu Dalang from the inside.

130
00:08:13,920 --> 00:08:14,830
If we borrow men,

131
00:08:15,032 --> 00:08:16,750
I'm afraid the moment
we step out the door,

132
00:08:16,870 --> 00:08:17,750
Lu Dalang and his men

133
00:08:17,750 --> 00:08:19,064
will already have been tipped off.

134
00:08:19,950 --> 00:08:21,070
Once we fail to catch him,

135
00:08:21,704 --> 00:08:23,660
someone eager
to curry favor with the Zhao family

136
00:08:23,680 --> 00:08:25,560
will surely impeach me
for disregarding the law

137
00:08:25,680 --> 00:08:27,192
and trespassing on private property.

138
00:08:27,816 --> 00:08:29,752
Then not only
will my offense be compounded,

139
00:08:29,912 --> 00:08:31,560
but my friends will also be implicated.

140
00:08:32,550 --> 00:08:34,080
We need to find a way inside

141
00:08:34,150 --> 00:08:35,240
and learn what's going on.

142
00:08:36,440 --> 00:08:38,000
To slip in unnoticed,

143
00:08:38,488 --> 00:08:40,080
we'd have to deal with the dogs first.

144
00:08:41,200 --> 00:08:42,550
But they're extremely vigilant.

145
00:08:42,960 --> 00:08:44,270
They won't even let peddlers near.

146
00:08:47,160 --> 00:08:49,080
Fourth Lady Li,
who makes reed down shoes,

147
00:08:49,080 --> 00:08:50,080
was allowed inside.

148
00:08:50,870 --> 00:08:52,360
Clearly, they're

149
00:08:52,790 --> 00:08:54,120
less wary of women.

150
00:09:07,256 --> 00:09:09,448
I'll disguise myself
as a woman and sneak in.

151
00:09:11,112 --> 00:09:12,600
You'd have to keep your head down

152
00:09:12,648 --> 00:09:14,440
even to fool
the women and children inside.

153
00:09:14,750 --> 00:09:15,870
If you meet anyone vigilant,

154
00:09:16,232 --> 00:09:17,550
they'll see through you at once.

155
00:09:29,320 --> 00:09:30,080
Young Master,

156
00:09:31,000 --> 00:09:31,480
I'll go.

157
00:09:42,080 --> 00:09:44,480
Aren't you afraid?

158
00:09:46,808 --> 00:09:48,600
This is Jinling, the Southern Capital.

159
00:09:48,720 --> 00:09:49,840
It's broad daylight.

160
00:09:50,024 --> 00:09:51,440
I'm only going inside the residence

161
00:09:51,440 --> 00:09:52,550
to see what's going on.

162
00:09:53,150 --> 00:09:54,270
What's there to be afraid of?

163
00:09:59,790 --> 00:10:01,360
If you help us catch Lu Dalang,

164
00:10:01,816 --> 00:10:03,320
you'll be handsomely rewarded.

165
00:10:04,080 --> 00:10:04,870
Remember,

166
00:10:05,600 --> 00:10:07,030
you must not act rashly.

167
00:10:07,336 --> 00:10:08,870
At worst, we'll come away empty-handed

168
00:10:09,510 --> 00:10:10,510
and find another way.

169
00:10:13,480 --> 00:10:14,670
The key is those two dogs.

170
00:10:14,776 --> 00:10:16,320
As long as we keep them from barking,

171
00:10:17,080 --> 00:10:18,840
Nanke and I can

172
00:10:18,840 --> 00:10:20,550
slip inside without anyone noticing.

173
00:10:44,408 --> 00:10:45,440
Who are you looking for?

174
00:10:45,840 --> 00:10:46,630
Sir,

175
00:10:47,840 --> 00:10:51,150
my husband came from
the capital to Jinling on business.

176
00:10:51,510 --> 00:10:53,000
He caught a cold by accident

177
00:10:53,000 --> 00:10:54,390
and never recovered.

178
00:10:55,000 --> 00:10:57,960
We spent all our money,
but he still died.

179
00:10:58,870 --> 00:11:00,550
I truly have nowhere else to turn.

180
00:11:00,750 --> 00:11:01,720
I heard you're hiring

181
00:11:01,910 --> 00:11:03,670
women who can sew.

182
00:11:04,510 --> 00:11:06,320
So I gathered
the courage to come and ask.

183
00:11:07,440 --> 00:11:09,030
Please, sir, have mercy.

184
00:11:09,030 --> 00:11:10,584
Please give me a way to earn my keep.

185
00:11:10,840 --> 00:11:12,080
How good are you at needlework?

186
00:11:13,030 --> 00:11:15,240
I made the clothes I'm wearing myself.

187
00:11:17,390 --> 00:11:19,750
I embroidered the flower
on this handkerchief, too.

188
00:11:52,000 --> 00:11:52,440
Come back.

189
00:11:57,870 --> 00:11:58,440
Let's go.

190
00:11:58,910 --> 00:12:00,248
I'll take you to see the owner.

191
00:12:52,550 --> 00:12:53,550
Wait here.

192
00:13:17,360 --> 00:13:18,550
Greetings, Madam.

193
00:13:25,630 --> 00:13:27,030
The women who worked here before

194
00:13:27,030 --> 00:13:28,240
had sticky fingers.

195
00:13:29,720 --> 00:13:30,870
It's best to check beforehand

196
00:13:31,480 --> 00:13:34,000
so there's no dispute
if anything happens.

197
00:13:40,080 --> 00:13:41,240
Embroider something.

198
00:13:41,510 --> 00:13:42,720
Let's see your skill.

199
00:14:03,960 --> 00:14:05,600
(There's a man inside, too.)

200
00:14:06,600 --> 00:14:08,320
(This woman is just a figurehead.)

201
00:14:09,624 --> 00:14:11,736
(Judging by the state
of the house inside and out,)

202
00:14:12,960 --> 00:14:14,600
(they're about to move away.)

203
00:14:38,648 --> 00:14:40,536
You're no match
for a professional embroiderer,

204
00:14:40,870 --> 00:14:41,840
but your work will do.

205
00:14:45,790 --> 00:14:47,750
What else can you do besides embroidery?

206
00:14:48,390 --> 00:14:49,390
Can you weave?

207
00:14:56,910 --> 00:14:57,750
Madam,

208
00:14:58,270 --> 00:14:59,320
to tell you the truth,

209
00:14:59,720 --> 00:15:02,120
I came today to ask another favor.

210
00:15:03,510 --> 00:15:04,550
After my husband died,

211
00:15:04,712 --> 00:15:06,790
I had no choice
but to rent a place in Kujing Lane.

212
00:15:07,200 --> 00:15:09,080
Fourth Lady Li,
who lives in the same lane,

213
00:15:09,270 --> 00:15:10,630
heard about my situation

214
00:15:10,870 --> 00:15:12,550
and told me you buy cotton here.

215
00:15:13,440 --> 00:15:15,510
My husband was a cotton merchant.

216
00:15:17,200 --> 00:15:20,600
But before he could sell his stock,

217
00:15:21,240 --> 00:15:23,720
he fell ill and passed away.

218
00:15:23,912 --> 00:15:25,630
It's already the second month of spring.

219
00:15:25,790 --> 00:15:27,150
It's getting warmer by the day.

220
00:15:27,240 --> 00:15:28,720
Who would still need cotton now?

221
00:15:30,200 --> 00:15:31,600
But if it's stored properly,

222
00:15:32,120 --> 00:15:33,600
it'll surely sell once the weather

223
00:15:33,600 --> 00:15:34,960
turns cold at year's end.

224
00:15:35,630 --> 00:15:37,320
Please, Madam, have mercy

225
00:15:37,320 --> 00:15:38,790
and buy my family's cotton.

226
00:15:40,000 --> 00:15:41,200
You can name the price.

227
00:15:42,080 --> 00:15:44,750
I only ask for enough
to return to the capital.

228
00:16:04,600 --> 00:16:05,550
This is Lu Dalang.

229
00:16:11,960 --> 00:16:13,150
You really have cotton?

230
00:16:13,150 --> 00:16:14,940
(Lu Dalang, Cotton Merchant)

231
00:16:15,550 --> 00:16:16,360
I do.

232
00:16:16,750 --> 00:16:18,270
Fourth Lady Li can vouch for me.

233
00:16:18,960 --> 00:16:19,840
The house I'm renting

234
00:16:19,840 --> 00:16:21,080
is right next to hers.

235
00:16:21,510 --> 00:16:22,960
When she helped me move the cotton,

236
00:16:22,960 --> 00:16:24,728
she even secretly
kept a little for herself.

237
00:16:25,510 --> 00:16:26,960
Now that my husband is gone,

238
00:16:27,016 --> 00:16:28,700
I'm hardly in a position
to argue over it.

239
00:16:28,840 --> 00:16:30,550
I can only pretend I don't know.

240
00:16:32,104 --> 00:16:34,490
Among the women who worked here
before the Chinese New Year,

241
00:16:34,616 --> 00:16:37,160
there was indeed a Fourth Lady Li
who liked taking things.

242
00:16:41,960 --> 00:16:43,150
Where is your cotton?

243
00:16:44,870 --> 00:16:46,390
At the house I'm renting.

244
00:16:46,840 --> 00:16:48,960
Several rooms are packed full of it.

245
00:16:49,480 --> 00:16:50,960
I'll sell it for next to nothing.

246
00:16:51,480 --> 00:16:53,200
I only need enough for my journey home.

247
00:16:58,600 --> 00:16:59,720
I'm telling the truth.

248
00:17:02,488 --> 00:17:04,880
Have someone rent a mule cart
from the brokerage house.

249
00:17:04,968 --> 00:17:06,310
I'll go with her and take a look.

250
00:17:06,720 --> 00:17:07,200
Yes.

251
00:17:55,760 --> 00:17:56,270
Wait.

252
00:18:02,160 --> 00:18:03,480
Why aren't the dogs barking?

253
00:18:05,440 --> 00:18:06,240
Lazy beasts!

254
00:18:06,270 --> 00:18:07,270
Wake up!

255
00:18:12,960 --> 00:18:14,200
Who came by today?

256
00:18:15,550 --> 00:18:16,310
Other than her,

257
00:18:16,310 --> 00:18:17,110
no one.

258
00:18:26,550 --> 00:18:27,200
Tell me.

259
00:18:27,480 --> 00:18:28,550
Who sent you?

260
00:18:29,400 --> 00:18:30,920
I'm just here to sell cotton.

261
00:18:31,110 --> 00:18:32,160
My husband died...

262
00:18:37,440 --> 00:18:38,400
If you don't come out,

263
00:18:39,350 --> 00:18:41,030
I'll kill this woman!

264
00:18:46,110 --> 00:18:46,720
Come out.

265
00:19:06,640 --> 00:19:08,510
So it's Assistant Commander Lin.

266
00:19:09,200 --> 00:19:10,350
What an honored guest.

267
00:19:10,830 --> 00:19:12,696
Forgive me
for not welcoming you properly!

268
00:19:35,550 --> 00:19:36,350
Lu Dalang,

269
00:19:37,030 --> 00:19:38,110
let her go first.

270
00:19:39,440 --> 00:19:40,480
Assistant Commander Lin,

271
00:19:41,590 --> 00:19:42,750
you step aside first.

272
00:19:42,750 --> 00:19:44,390
As long as I can
get safely into the cart

273
00:19:44,408 --> 00:19:45,432
and leave this place,

274
00:19:45,790 --> 00:19:46,720
I'll let her go.

275
00:19:48,830 --> 00:19:51,830
If I can't get out of here safely today,

276
00:19:52,680 --> 00:19:54,510
this woman dies first.

277
00:19:55,640 --> 00:19:56,440
Move.

278
00:19:59,440 --> 00:20:00,680
Move!

279
00:20:07,592 --> 00:20:09,496
Young Master,
you've lived a life of privilege.

280
00:20:10,072 --> 00:20:12,328
You don't know that
for people at the bottom like us,

281
00:20:12,550 --> 00:20:14,030
sometimes just staying alive

282
00:20:14,510 --> 00:20:16,000
takes everything we have.

283
00:20:19,550 --> 00:20:20,960
If we want to rise above our station

284
00:20:20,960 --> 00:20:22,160
and live a little better,

285
00:20:23,880 --> 00:20:25,590
we may have to abandon our conscience

286
00:20:26,160 --> 00:20:27,350
and risk our lives.

287
00:20:36,030 --> 00:20:37,550
I said move!

288
00:20:59,540 --> 00:21:06,760
♪I no longer blame
the moon for withholding its light♪

289
00:21:07,070 --> 00:21:14,330
♪I only pray that those
I've known still live and thrive♪

290
00:21:14,750 --> 00:21:18,990
♪No longer
let the world's wind and snow fall♪

291
00:21:18,990 --> 00:21:21,840
♪And leave the grass
and trees covered in frost♪

292
00:21:22,210 --> 00:21:26,270
♪I only wish that
where the lights grow dim♪

293
00:21:26,410 --> 00:21:32,460
♪You and I will walk there together♪

294
00:22:52,790 --> 00:22:53,720
With all this commotion,

295
00:22:53,730 --> 00:22:55,310
the men from the Five City Patrol Office

296
00:22:55,320 --> 00:22:56,344
will be here soon.

297
00:22:57,030 --> 00:22:58,110
You can't escape.

298
00:22:58,350 --> 00:22:59,270
Come back with me

299
00:22:59,720 --> 00:23:00,920
and explain everything.

300
00:23:01,640 --> 00:23:03,070
I know you were only an accomplice.

301
00:23:03,112 --> 00:23:04,640
Your crime doesn't warrant death.

302
00:23:35,400 --> 00:23:36,880
Assistant Commander Lin,

303
00:23:37,720 --> 00:23:41,590
it's not that
I couldn't defeat you today.

304
00:23:42,680 --> 00:23:43,720
It's just that

305
00:23:44,270 --> 00:23:48,110
this woman was cunning.

306
00:23:49,400 --> 00:23:50,960
Cunning!

307
00:24:29,960 --> 00:24:30,550
Nanke,

308
00:24:31,032 --> 00:24:33,660
Jiugao and I will go with the men
from the Five City Patrol Office.

309
00:24:33,670 --> 00:24:35,950
Take Lanxiang to a medical hall
to have her wound dressed,

310
00:24:35,960 --> 00:24:36,696
and send her back.

311
00:24:37,270 --> 00:24:37,640
Yes.

312
00:24:59,180 --> 00:25:02,020
(Liu Xiaochuan, Sixth-Rank Commander
of the Southern City Patrol Office)

313
00:25:02,030 --> 00:25:04,000
A young maid
really stabbed him with this?

314
00:25:06,000 --> 00:25:08,070
That girl is ruthless.

315
00:25:08,110 --> 00:25:08,790
If word gets out,

316
00:25:08,790 --> 00:25:09,920
who would dare marry her?

317
00:25:09,920 --> 00:25:10,680
Just looking at it

318
00:25:10,680 --> 00:25:11,720
makes me shudder.

319
00:25:11,750 --> 00:25:12,880
Look.

320
00:25:13,350 --> 00:25:14,590
Whoever marries a wife like that

321
00:25:14,590 --> 00:25:16,248
would never dare visit a pleasure house.

322
00:25:22,310 --> 00:25:24,200
Lu Dalang was tough, too.

323
00:25:25,070 --> 00:25:26,510
He had a needle stuck in him

324
00:25:27,480 --> 00:25:28,720
and could still fight me.

325
00:25:29,830 --> 00:25:31,110
He didn't seem like a merchant.

326
00:25:32,440 --> 00:25:35,200
Merchants who travel far and wide
can put profit above all else.

327
00:25:35,200 --> 00:25:37,192
Sometimes they're
even more ruthless than bandits.

328
00:25:37,200 --> 00:25:39,130
How else could
they make a fortune in business?

329
00:25:39,144 --> 00:25:39,816
Gloves.

330
00:26:20,872 --> 00:26:23,240
What's so interesting
about these calluses?

331
00:26:38,070 --> 00:26:39,110
When he took his own life,

332
00:26:39,110 --> 00:26:40,248
did he cut across the wound?

333
00:26:40,270 --> 00:26:42,110
The fatal wound
was indeed a horizontal cut

334
00:26:42,312 --> 00:26:43,790
before the blade was thrust deeper.

335
00:27:13,640 --> 00:27:14,270
Young Master.

336
00:27:17,510 --> 00:27:19,750
The physician said
the flesh wound is nothing serious.

337
00:27:20,210 --> 00:27:21,220
With some topical medicine

338
00:27:21,230 --> 00:27:22,400
and proper rest, it'll heal.

339
00:27:22,660 --> 00:27:24,090
But he was concerned about the shock,

340
00:27:24,100 --> 00:27:25,860
so he prescribed something
to calm the mind.

341
00:27:25,870 --> 00:27:28,216
It should be taken for five days
before seeing how things go.

342
00:27:40,480 --> 00:27:41,110
Let me.

343
00:27:43,350 --> 00:27:43,960
Easy.

344
00:27:55,590 --> 00:27:56,680
Lie down and rest.

345
00:27:57,480 --> 00:27:59,544
Young Master doesn't care
about such formalities.

346
00:28:01,310 --> 00:28:01,960
How are you?

347
00:28:02,510 --> 00:28:03,270
Can you talk?

348
00:28:07,064 --> 00:28:08,550
My head just feels a little heavy.

349
00:28:08,872 --> 00:28:10,000
Once I've taken the medicine

350
00:28:10,000 --> 00:28:11,550
and had a good sleep, I'll be fine.

351
00:28:11,832 --> 00:28:13,480
If you have questions, Young Master,

352
00:28:13,590 --> 00:28:14,400
just ask.

353
00:28:14,960 --> 00:28:15,960
I can talk.

354
00:28:17,510 --> 00:28:19,720
I want to know what happened

355
00:28:19,790 --> 00:28:21,160
after you entered the residence.

356
00:28:23,928 --> 00:28:25,170
It concerns the investigation.

357
00:28:25,310 --> 00:28:27,160
Tell me everything,
no matter how trivial.

358
00:28:33,880 --> 00:28:35,030
After entering the residence,

359
00:28:35,550 --> 00:28:37,110
I did as Jiugao taught me.

360
00:28:37,400 --> 00:28:40,270
I found a way to toss
the drugged handkerchief

361
00:28:40,270 --> 00:28:41,920
into the dogs' drinking water.

362
00:28:42,270 --> 00:28:44,400
Then I followed
a servant farther inside.

363
00:28:45,920 --> 00:28:48,510
I noticed the plants around
the residence were withered,

364
00:28:48,920 --> 00:28:50,590
but the servants were well dressed.

365
00:28:51,000 --> 00:28:53,240
The two large dogs
were also strong and healthy.

366
00:28:54,310 --> 00:28:54,960
That showed

367
00:28:55,830 --> 00:28:57,070
the owner wasn't short of money.

368
00:28:57,752 --> 00:28:59,510
He simply didn't
regard that place as home.

369
00:28:59,750 --> 00:29:01,590
It was only a temporary hideout.

370
00:29:02,240 --> 00:29:04,550
That made it even more likely

371
00:29:04,632 --> 00:29:05,960
that Lu Dalang was hiding there.

372
00:29:07,310 --> 00:29:10,720
I also noticed the east
and west wings were shut tight.

373
00:29:10,856 --> 00:29:12,510
The main house was sparsely furnished.

374
00:29:13,830 --> 00:29:15,960
That suggested
they'd either just moved in

375
00:29:16,310 --> 00:29:18,680
or were about to leave soon.

376
00:29:19,550 --> 00:29:21,750
I knew you were eager to catch Lu Dalang

377
00:29:21,960 --> 00:29:23,480
and couldn't let him escape.

378
00:29:23,960 --> 00:29:24,960
In desperation,

379
00:29:25,350 --> 00:29:27,720
I came up with a plan,
though it wasn't much of one.

380
00:29:28,270 --> 00:29:29,400
I took a chance and said

381
00:29:30,110 --> 00:29:32,000
I had a stockpile of cotton to sell.

382
00:29:39,510 --> 00:29:40,856
Lu Dalang even wanted the cotton

383
00:29:40,860 --> 00:29:42,744
from the Shence Garrison's padded coats,

384
00:29:43,110 --> 00:29:46,440
so clearly he was greedy for cotton.

385
00:29:47,920 --> 00:29:50,550
Birds die for food, and men for wealth.

386
00:29:51,310 --> 00:29:53,880
Lu Dalang had
been hiding in the inner room,

387
00:29:54,088 --> 00:29:55,510
but the moment he heard I had cotton,

388
00:29:55,590 --> 00:29:56,720
he came out.

389
00:29:57,640 --> 00:29:59,240
When he saw I was a widow,

390
00:29:59,310 --> 00:30:01,048
he thought
he could take advantage of me,

391
00:30:01,720 --> 00:30:03,720
so he wanted to come
with me to see the cotton.

392
00:30:06,110 --> 00:30:08,510
Where did you get that needle?

393
00:30:14,000 --> 00:30:16,720
Lu Dalang's wife
wanted to see my needlework.

394
00:30:16,968 --> 00:30:18,552
She brought out a needle and thread

395
00:30:18,584 --> 00:30:20,008
and asked me to embroider something.

396
00:30:21,240 --> 00:30:22,240
At the time, I suspected

397
00:30:22,960 --> 00:30:25,350
Lu Dalang was in the inner room.

398
00:30:26,040 --> 00:30:27,480
I wasn't sure what might happen,

399
00:30:27,590 --> 00:30:29,448
so I took the opportunity
to hide a needle

400
00:30:30,110 --> 00:30:31,510
in case I needed it.

401
00:30:33,070 --> 00:30:33,920
I never expected

402
00:30:35,070 --> 00:30:36,440
I'd actually have to use it.

403
00:30:40,240 --> 00:30:41,070
Apart from that,

404
00:30:41,928 --> 00:30:44,104
is there anything else
you want to tell me?

405
00:30:46,632 --> 00:30:49,110
The servants knew there were
women in the inner quarters,

406
00:30:49,270 --> 00:30:50,840
yet they came and went as they pleased.

407
00:30:51,000 --> 00:30:52,440
The madam of the house

408
00:30:52,510 --> 00:30:53,920
wasn't bothered by it at all.

409
00:30:53,920 --> 00:30:55,352
The masters didn't act like masters,

410
00:30:55,360 --> 00:30:57,064
and the servants
didn't act like servants.

411
00:30:57,270 --> 00:30:58,510
Even a merchant household

412
00:30:58,590 --> 00:31:00,160
wouldn't be so lacking in propriety.

413
00:31:01,240 --> 00:31:02,270
That woman

414
00:31:03,160 --> 00:31:05,110
probably wasn't Lu Dalang's wife.

415
00:31:05,750 --> 00:31:06,590
Lu Dalang

416
00:31:07,550 --> 00:31:08,920
didn't seem like a merchant.

417
00:31:32,720 --> 00:31:33,510
Young Master,

418
00:31:34,480 --> 00:31:36,480
did I get something wrong?

419
00:31:41,048 --> 00:31:42,200
Everything you said was right.

420
00:31:43,064 --> 00:31:44,070
I promised you before

421
00:31:44,088 --> 00:31:46,390
that you'd be handsomely rewarded
if we caught Lu Dalang.

422
00:31:47,000 --> 00:31:48,030
What would you like?

423
00:31:53,310 --> 00:31:56,480
I can't think of anything
I want right now.

424
00:31:56,920 --> 00:31:57,720
Why don't I

425
00:31:57,790 --> 00:31:59,510
save up the favor for now?

426
00:31:59,830 --> 00:32:00,720
Once I've decided,

427
00:32:00,720 --> 00:32:02,030
I'll ask you for something.

428
00:32:04,920 --> 00:32:05,480
All right.

429
00:32:06,440 --> 00:32:08,590
Come to me once you've decided.

430
00:32:10,808 --> 00:32:12,328
Take good care of Lanxiang.

431
00:32:12,392 --> 00:32:14,350
The fewer people
who know Lanxiang was injured,

432
00:32:14,360 --> 00:32:15,550
the better.

433
00:32:16,160 --> 00:32:17,920
Don't let her parents hear about it.

434
00:32:23,176 --> 00:32:24,376
Thank you, Young Master.

435
00:32:31,672 --> 00:32:33,672
Whenever I was wounded
on the battlefield,

436
00:32:33,830 --> 00:32:36,310
what I feared most
was First Madam finding out

437
00:32:36,400 --> 00:32:38,070
and worrying herself sick.

438
00:32:51,480 --> 00:32:52,856
The medicine is ready.

439
00:32:59,070 --> 00:32:59,400
Here.

440
00:32:59,400 --> 00:33:00,070
I'll feed you.

441
00:33:01,110 --> 00:33:02,880
Medicine isn't meant to taste good.

442
00:33:03,160 --> 00:33:04,790
It's best to drink it all at once.

443
00:33:05,400 --> 00:33:06,400
Taking it sip by sip

444
00:33:07,030 --> 00:33:08,830
only makes me savor the bitterness.

445
00:33:12,880 --> 00:33:13,640
Careful. It's hot.

446
00:33:13,960 --> 00:33:14,750
Bitter, isn't it?

447
00:33:24,510 --> 00:33:25,270
Don't worry.

448
00:33:25,510 --> 00:33:27,310
Only Gantang and I
know what really happened.

449
00:33:27,400 --> 00:33:29,000
None of the other maids know.

450
00:33:29,720 --> 00:33:30,790
With my skills,

451
00:33:30,830 --> 00:33:33,496
even if Xiaolian's mother came
to collect the night soil every day,

452
00:33:33,544 --> 00:33:35,030
she wouldn't hear a thing.

453
00:33:35,510 --> 00:33:36,880
Thank you, Yuchan.

454
00:33:37,750 --> 00:33:39,510
You've truly been
a great help this time.

455
00:33:39,592 --> 00:33:41,310
Sleep while the medicine
is taking effect.

456
00:33:41,310 --> 00:33:42,310
You'll heal faster.

457
00:33:43,680 --> 00:33:44,350
Just sleep.

458
00:33:53,460 --> 00:33:54,780
(Sanjue Hall)

459
00:33:54,790 --> 00:33:57,920
You didn't see that needle go in.

460
00:33:58,030 --> 00:33:59,832
You have no idea
how fierce Lanxiang was.

461
00:33:59,920 --> 00:34:00,720
I know.

462
00:34:01,440 --> 00:34:03,000
I saw it in her eyes.

463
00:34:04,200 --> 00:34:06,310
Once, when we
were surrounded by Wo pirates,

464
00:34:08,360 --> 00:34:10,320
Young Master
had that same look in his eyes.

465
00:34:13,280 --> 00:34:14,440
What kind of look?

466
00:34:16,840 --> 00:34:18,230
A fierce look

467
00:34:19,480 --> 00:34:20,880
that said he had to survive.

468
00:34:30,030 --> 00:34:30,840
Young Master.

469
00:34:32,110 --> 00:34:32,760
Young Master.

470
00:34:33,110 --> 00:34:33,550
Sit.

471
00:34:34,104 --> 00:34:36,456
Did you get the statements
from those four servants?

472
00:34:36,710 --> 00:34:37,510
Yes.

473
00:34:37,880 --> 00:34:39,320
There wasn't a single useful lead.

474
00:34:39,760 --> 00:34:40,960
They're thugs from Yangzhou

475
00:34:41,440 --> 00:34:42,510
who know how to fight.

476
00:34:42,856 --> 00:34:44,248
Lu Dalang paid them well

477
00:34:44,312 --> 00:34:45,400
to guard the residence.

478
00:34:45,760 --> 00:34:47,000
Whatever they knew,

479
00:34:47,150 --> 00:34:48,440
we already knew.

480
00:34:50,630 --> 00:34:52,590
That woman was bought by Lu Dalang

481
00:34:53,110 --> 00:34:54,400
from a brokerage house in Suzhou.

482
00:34:55,030 --> 00:34:57,360
She knew even less
than those four hired thugs.

483
00:34:59,480 --> 00:35:00,800
With Lu Dalang dead,

484
00:35:02,110 --> 00:35:04,230
we've lost every lead.

485
00:35:11,400 --> 00:35:13,590
I know Lu Dalang's true identity.

486
00:35:17,360 --> 00:35:20,800
Lu Dalang was from the Wo country.

487
00:35:25,320 --> 00:35:27,240
No wonder he had
calluses between his toes.

488
00:35:27,576 --> 00:35:29,112
The Wo people often wear wooden clogs.

489
00:35:29,912 --> 00:35:31,320
When Lu Dalang took his own life,

490
00:35:31,630 --> 00:35:32,630
the way he held the blade

491
00:35:32,630 --> 00:35:34,540
looked more like a Wo pirate
committing ritual suicide.

492
00:35:34,550 --> 00:35:36,024
He only changed his grip afterward.

493
00:35:36,190 --> 00:35:37,480
With just those two clues,

494
00:35:37,640 --> 00:35:39,112
aren't we jumping to conclusions?

495
00:35:40,510 --> 00:35:43,150
He was unusually greedy for cotton.

496
00:35:43,760 --> 00:35:45,360
Lanxiang lured him with cotton,

497
00:35:45,590 --> 00:35:46,920
and he walked right into the trap.

498
00:35:47,400 --> 00:35:48,760
It's already mid-spring.

499
00:35:49,920 --> 00:35:51,800
Even if the cotton were shipped north,

500
00:35:52,000 --> 00:35:53,030
it wouldn't be worth much.

501
00:35:53,400 --> 00:35:54,710
Unless there was somewhere

502
00:35:55,630 --> 00:35:57,880
that needed cotton
regardless of the season.

503
00:35:59,510 --> 00:36:00,360
Wo country.

504
00:36:02,440 --> 00:36:03,400
In the previous dynasty,

505
00:36:03,710 --> 00:36:05,190
cotton was a rarity.

506
00:36:05,288 --> 00:36:07,360
Only after the late Emperor
promoted its cultivation

507
00:36:07,590 --> 00:36:09,760
did the prices of cotton
and cotton cloth come down.

508
00:36:10,400 --> 00:36:13,150
But cotton remains scarce in Wo country.

509
00:36:13,360 --> 00:36:14,630
If smuggled there,

510
00:36:14,712 --> 00:36:16,312
it can yield several times the profit.

511
00:36:16,550 --> 00:36:18,400
But the late Emperor
imposed a maritime ban,

512
00:36:18,920 --> 00:36:21,400
so the Wo people
cannot purchase it openly.

513
00:36:22,000 --> 00:36:23,360
So he was from the Wo country.

514
00:36:24,590 --> 00:36:26,710
This case isn't
about embezzlement or bribery

515
00:36:26,710 --> 00:36:27,670
for petty profit.

516
00:36:28,920 --> 00:36:31,320
Officials at court
are colluding with the Wo people.

517
00:36:31,630 --> 00:36:32,800
defying the Emperor's will

518
00:36:32,904 --> 00:36:34,616
and engaging in illegal smuggling.

519
00:36:34,824 --> 00:36:35,860
(Map of Nanzhi County)

520
00:36:37,630 --> 00:36:38,480
Lanxiang surmised

521
00:36:38,568 --> 00:36:40,904
that Lu Dalang was about to move
within a day or two.

522
00:36:41,320 --> 00:36:43,110
And when he heard Lanxiang had cotton,

523
00:36:43,110 --> 00:36:44,230
he was eager to see it.

524
00:36:44,760 --> 00:36:46,230
Lanxiang's deduction should be right.

525
00:36:46,280 --> 00:36:47,704
But he wasn't preparing to move.

526
00:36:48,030 --> 00:36:50,360
Lu Dalang's cotton is about
to be shipped out of Jinling

527
00:36:50,670 --> 00:36:51,670
within a day or two.

528
00:36:52,900 --> 00:36:54,260
(Wo Country)

529
00:36:56,190 --> 00:36:58,150
Nanke and I will investigate right away.

530
00:36:58,760 --> 00:37:00,550
We'll stop both the shipment and the men

531
00:37:00,710 --> 00:37:01,960
before they leave Jinling.

532
00:37:03,032 --> 00:37:04,824
While we're away from you, Young Master,

533
00:37:04,880 --> 00:37:06,510
don't go out for the next two days.

534
00:37:07,080 --> 00:37:08,488
I've already made arrangements.

535
00:37:08,630 --> 00:37:09,440
As for you two,

536
00:37:09,710 --> 00:37:10,550
be extremely careful.

537
00:37:12,232 --> 00:37:13,176
- Yes.
- Yes.

538
00:37:29,224 --> 00:37:31,190
I hope you can live
better lives than before.

539
00:37:31,190 --> 00:37:31,920
This is Jinling, the Southern Capital.

540
00:37:31,920 --> 00:37:33,280
Wait for the right moment
to make a move.

541
00:37:33,280 --> 00:37:33,710
What's there to be afraid of?

542
00:37:33,710 --> 00:37:34,360
Become free commoners.

543
00:37:34,360 --> 00:37:35,840
Aren't you afraid?

544
00:37:40,110 --> 00:37:40,920
What's wrong?

545
00:37:45,630 --> 00:37:46,960
Does your wound hurt?

546
00:37:48,880 --> 00:37:50,280
I had a nightmare.

547
00:37:51,190 --> 00:37:52,190
It startled me awake.

548
00:37:54,630 --> 00:37:55,768
What did you dream about?

549
00:37:57,840 --> 00:37:58,710
I dreamed

550
00:38:00,000 --> 00:38:02,800
that man was swinging his blade wildly.

551
00:38:04,000 --> 00:38:05,280
There was blood everywhere.

552
00:38:06,480 --> 00:38:07,280
And...

553
00:38:08,000 --> 00:38:09,590
my family's bodies.

554
00:38:22,712 --> 00:38:24,190
Anyone who saw blood during the day

555
00:38:24,510 --> 00:38:26,190
would have nightmares at night.

556
00:38:27,960 --> 00:38:28,760
Don't be afraid.

557
00:38:29,190 --> 00:38:30,400
Dreams mean the opposite.

558
00:38:32,280 --> 00:38:34,230
When the blade was held to my throat,

559
00:38:36,070 --> 00:38:39,070
I was terrified
and regretted what I'd done.

560
00:38:41,280 --> 00:38:42,960
If I hadn't stepped in,

561
00:38:43,960 --> 00:38:46,480
I wouldn't have ended up in such danger.

562
00:38:49,110 --> 00:38:50,510
If I had died,

563
00:38:52,030 --> 00:38:53,800
my father and mother

564
00:38:54,840 --> 00:38:56,400
would never have been able to go on.

565
00:38:57,976 --> 00:38:59,800
I wouldn't
just have gotten myself killed.

566
00:39:01,230 --> 00:39:02,800
I would've cost them their lives, too.

567
00:39:16,110 --> 00:39:17,070
There's something

568
00:39:17,816 --> 00:39:19,670
I've wanted to tell you for a long time,

569
00:39:20,190 --> 00:39:22,190
but I've always
been too embarrassed to say it.

570
00:39:25,190 --> 00:39:28,590
My life is different
from yours and Xiaolian's.

571
00:39:29,960 --> 00:39:31,070
You don't have to say it.

572
00:39:31,128 --> 00:39:32,888
You're your parents' precious daughter.

573
00:39:33,512 --> 00:39:35,000
Xiaolian may have an older brother,

574
00:39:35,360 --> 00:39:38,400
but her grandmother
and mother both cherish her.

575
00:39:39,960 --> 00:39:42,190
I'm the second child in my family.

576
00:39:43,400 --> 00:39:45,510
I have an older brother

577
00:39:46,150 --> 00:39:48,190
and a younger brother.

578
00:39:49,400 --> 00:39:50,480
Ever since I was little,

579
00:39:50,744 --> 00:39:52,808
my parents have always
favored my brothers.

580
00:39:53,800 --> 00:39:54,590
Some time ago,

581
00:39:54,696 --> 00:39:56,920
my mother was arranging
a marriage for my older brother,

582
00:39:57,112 --> 00:39:59,384
but our family
couldn't afford the betrothal gifts.

583
00:39:59,800 --> 00:40:01,760
So my parents wanted

584
00:40:01,760 --> 00:40:03,528
to arrange my marriage
as soon as possible

585
00:40:03,800 --> 00:40:05,070
and use my betrothal gifts

586
00:40:06,400 --> 00:40:07,510
for my older brother.

587
00:40:09,000 --> 00:40:10,110
They called it a betrothal,

588
00:40:11,128 --> 00:40:13,208
but they were
really selling their daughter.

589
00:40:14,408 --> 00:40:15,670
They didn't care who it was,

590
00:40:16,000 --> 00:40:17,150
as long as he paid enough.

591
00:40:19,630 --> 00:40:21,000
Luckily, on the Festival of Man,

592
00:40:21,190 --> 00:40:22,960
I somehow followed your lead

593
00:40:23,176 --> 00:40:24,600
and ended up earning some merit.

594
00:40:24,880 --> 00:40:28,000
First Madam rewarded me
with ten taels of silver,

595
00:40:28,190 --> 00:40:28,880
and Young Master

596
00:40:29,110 --> 00:40:30,510
rewarded me with five taels.

597
00:40:30,616 --> 00:40:32,904
That was enough to cover
my brother's betrothal gifts.

598
00:40:34,190 --> 00:40:36,710
Only then did my mother agree

599
00:40:39,000 --> 00:40:41,440
not to rush me into a marriage.

600
00:40:47,360 --> 00:40:48,510
If you hadn't

601
00:40:49,510 --> 00:40:50,590
stepped in that day,

602
00:40:53,280 --> 00:40:54,590
my whole life

603
00:40:55,280 --> 00:40:56,190
would've been ruined.

604
00:40:57,670 --> 00:40:58,800
Completely ruined.

605
00:41:10,800 --> 00:41:11,590
Lanxiang,

606
00:41:13,590 --> 00:41:16,110
we're at the very bottom.

607
00:41:18,070 --> 00:41:19,400
If we don't take risks ourselves

608
00:41:19,590 --> 00:41:21,110
and fight for a way out,

609
00:41:21,550 --> 00:41:23,550
we'll remain
at the bottom all our lives.

610
00:41:24,800 --> 00:41:25,800
To everyone else,

611
00:41:26,400 --> 00:41:27,920
even to our own parents,

612
00:41:29,070 --> 00:41:31,360
we're only useful
for getting their sons wives.

613
00:41:32,480 --> 00:41:33,880
It was because you stepped in

614
00:41:35,000 --> 00:41:36,670
that you saved Young Master's marriage,

615
00:41:37,800 --> 00:41:39,480
saved the Lin family's reputation,

616
00:41:41,760 --> 00:41:42,920
and saved me, too.

617
00:41:43,570 --> 00:41:48,220
♪Even if these trials
consume my whole life♪

618
00:41:48,670 --> 00:41:52,790
♪I'll only return
to the moment our fate began♪

619
00:41:53,230 --> 00:41:54,910
♪I've searched and searched♪

620
00:41:55,110 --> 00:41:56,110
Don't be sad anymore.

621
00:41:56,760 --> 00:41:58,760
I'll stay and sleep beside you tonight.

622
00:41:59,000 --> 00:41:59,800
All right?

623
00:41:59,800 --> 00:42:02,000
♪Leaving only regret behind♪

624
00:42:02,000 --> 00:42:02,550
Come.

625
00:42:02,730 --> 00:42:07,120
♪Thankfully, these trials
have spared me a lifetime♪

626
00:42:07,570 --> 00:42:12,810
♪In this life and the next,
it will always be you♪

627
00:42:13,200 --> 00:42:20,920
♪I only pray
that fate lets us meet sooner♪

628
00:42:20,960 --> 00:42:22,000
Get some sleep.

629
00:42:22,550 --> 00:42:24,550
If that bad man
comes back to torment you

630
00:42:24,550 --> 00:42:26,110
in your dreams tonight,

631
00:42:26,550 --> 00:42:27,590
call me and I'll help you.

632
00:42:27,800 --> 00:42:30,000
We'll spit right in his face together.

633
00:42:37,510 --> 00:42:39,800
We must live our lives with dignity.

634
00:42:40,800 --> 00:42:41,630
We're not afraid of

635
00:42:41,630 --> 00:42:43,752
an evil spirit that
can't even face the light of day.

636
00:43:05,020 --> 00:43:07,940
=Against the Current=
(Next Episode's Preview)

637
00:43:10,904 --> 00:43:12,696
Where did Yuchan and Lanxiang go?

638
00:43:14,110 --> 00:43:15,230
They're still not back?

639
00:43:15,448 --> 00:43:17,464
Marquis Yongchang
was afraid word might get out,

640
00:43:17,710 --> 00:43:18,920
so he had Yuchan and Lanxiang

641
00:43:18,920 --> 00:43:20,030
taken to the Naval Camp.

642
00:43:20,408 --> 00:43:23,032
I thought after we caught
the Wo pirates last night,

643
00:43:23,040 --> 00:43:25,400
Marquis Yongchang would send
someone to bring them back.

644
00:43:26,320 --> 00:43:28,216
Could Marquis Yongchang
have simply forgotten

645
00:43:28,480 --> 00:43:30,280
about Yuchan and Lanxiang?

646
00:43:30,408 --> 00:43:32,360
Yuchan has never
been inside a military camp.

647
00:43:32,590 --> 00:43:33,670
Being kept there all night

648
00:43:33,670 --> 00:43:34,984
must have frightened her badly.

649
00:43:35,510 --> 00:43:36,230
No.

650
00:43:36,344 --> 00:43:38,328
I have to go to the Naval Camp
and bring her back.

651
00:43:39,320 --> 00:43:39,880
Stop.

652
00:43:41,760 --> 00:43:42,760
I'll go with you.

653
00:43:43,432 --> 00:43:44,070
Young Master.

654
00:43:59,300 --> 00:44:03,420
♪Spring slips from the
branches once more♪

655
00:44:06,260 --> 00:44:10,780
♪Flowers bloom unseen,
as they have before♪

656
00:44:12,060 --> 00:44:15,980
♪All the joys and sorrows come and go♪

657
00:44:16,660 --> 00:44:19,420
♪While loss leaves winter in the heart♪

658
00:44:20,140 --> 00:44:22,460
♪Though all the world may fade♪

659
00:44:22,460 --> 00:44:25,540
♪Time rolls on as
countless lives rush by♪

660
00:44:27,060 --> 00:44:31,300
♪Night winds wander
through the halls of long ago♪

661
00:44:34,220 --> 00:44:38,380
♪No page could hold the
longing words can never show♪

662
00:44:40,180 --> 00:44:43,740
♪Every joy and sorrow
in this fleeting life♪

663
00:44:43,740 --> 00:44:47,300
♪Fades into the past
as new wounds rise♪

664
00:44:48,100 --> 00:44:53,780
♪While whispers of perfume
linger beneath the eaves♪

665
00:44:54,140 --> 00:44:58,460
♪Let the cold wind rage,
let the wild rain fall♪

666
00:44:58,820 --> 00:45:01,780
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

667
00:45:01,780 --> 00:45:05,540
♪Let love fall to pieces,
let old anger burn away♪

668
00:45:05,540 --> 00:45:08,420
♪Let the past die with yesterday♪

669
00:45:08,420 --> 00:45:12,500
♪One last fire, one last cup of wine♪

670
00:45:12,500 --> 00:45:15,860
♪And silver moonlight to
guide me through the night♪

671
00:45:15,860 --> 00:45:19,620
♪Let beginnings fade
as endings come to call♪

672
00:45:19,620 --> 00:45:23,620
♪From this endless dream,
there's no return at all♪

673
00:45:24,380 --> 00:45:28,540
♪Let the cold wind rage,
let the wild rain fall♪

674
00:45:28,540 --> 00:45:31,980
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

675
